# Three turns in a function that stands in no loop are written out into straight code. Straight code is in no loop, so a callee of twelve operations, which the rule of loops alone would copy, stayed three calls, and nothing that a loop opens opened in it.
# Such a loop stays a loop and holds one copy of its callee: no call is left.
